{"id":"wb-7-1214","name":"胜像宝塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"胜像宝塔","text":"胜像宝塔，位于中华人民共和国湖北省武汉市武昌区黄鹤楼街道黄鹤楼景区内，是一座覆钵式佛塔，也是武汉市现存的唯一一座覆钵式佛塔。该塔始建于元至正三年（1343年），原位于蛇山一侧的黄鹄矶，1955年迁至蛇山山顶。2013年，胜像宝塔被列为全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%83%9C%E5%83%8F%E5%AE%9D%E5%A1%94","revisionId":91293676,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=91293676","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/4e31d752f5c3d374d00005ca.jpg","title":"胜像宝塔.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E8%83%9C%E5%83%8F%E5%AE%9D%E5%A1%94.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/78/%E8%83%9C%E5%83%8F%E5%AE%9D%E5%A1%94.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"霧島聖","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​胜像宝塔正面图片。","width":320,"height":427}}